reground" aria-label="24/7 Customer Support" class="_unitWrap_bfwln_36"><div class="_cardContainer_1pe96_3 _vertical_1pe96_24 _tileCardInner_bfwln_248"><div class="_cardLayout_1pe96_83 _tileCardLayout_bfwln_255"><div class="_tileContent_bfwln_261"><div><div class="_svgBackground_bfwln_44"><span class="_icon_j06u8_3" data-dls-icon-size="md" data-dls-icon-color="brand" data-testid="key-benefit-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 48 48" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-labelledby="benefit-icon-iconroundtheclock" aria-hidden="false" role="img" width="1em" height="1em"><title id="benefit-icon-iconroundtheclock">24/7 Customer Support icon</title><path d="M24.001 1.5a21.84 21.84 0 0 1 15.872 6.836l.292.315 1.336 1.469V8a1.5 1.5 0 0 1 1.355-1.493L43 6.5a1.5 1.5 0 0 1 1.493 1.356L44.5 8l-.002 6.071-.014.147-.018.1-.056.194-.057.135-.071.132-.098.142-.083.097-.09.089-.054.047-.112.085-.122.075-.127.062-.121.046-.147.041-.109.02-.145.014-6.073.002a1.5 1.5 0 0 1-.145-2.993l.144-.007h2.609l-1.665-1.831a18.85 18.85 0 0 0-13.526-6.164L24 4.5C13.23 4.5 4.5 13.23 4.5 24S13.23 43.5 24 43.5c10.655 0 19.314-8.546 19.497-19.157L43.5 24v-1a1.5 1.5 0 0 1 2.993-.145L46.5 23v1c0 12.426-10.074 22.5-22.5 22.5S1.5 36.426 1.5 24c0-12.302 9.874-22.298 22.128-22.497zm-6.786 15.494c3.07 0 4.826 1.671 4.826 4.277 0 1.579-.398 2.989-2.907 4.702l-.76.505-.239.162-.454.317c-1.386.987-2.257 1.817-2.318 2.51h6.679v2.526H11.637v-.318l.005-.336.015-.335c.122-1.898.877-3.789 4.245-6.014l.93-.613.397-.272c1.248-.874 1.761-1.469 1.761-2.616 0-1.094-.676-1.791-1.873-1.791-1.119 0-2.297.757-3.127 2.109l-2.219-1.612c1.235-1.949 2.915-3.202 5.442-3.202zm16.779 0v9.466h2.535v2.595h-2.535v2.94h-3.185v-2.94h-7.281v-2.392l6.835-9.669zm-3.185 3.932h-.04l-3.833 5.533h3.873z"></path></svg></span></div></div><div><h3 class="_tileHeader_bfwln_276">24/7 Customer Support</h3><p class="_content_bfwln_53">Bank confidently with world-class customer service from American Express</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><div><section class="screen-bleed screen-bleed-gray"><div class="_container_17bj8_1 width-full height-full text-align-center section-container"><section class="container--1-j60 horizontal---OJ1g _contentTile_17bj8_5"><div data-dls-surface="foreground" class="_surface_1ypbo_3"><div class="body-left--reJMC"><div class="image-left--lNBa2"><picture><img loading="lazy" src="https://icm.aexp-static.com/Internet/Acquisition/US_en/AppContent/OneSite/hysa/uplift/2-steps-desktop.png" class="_imageStyle_17bj8_100 width-full height-full" alt=""/></picture></div><article class="content--mPGHX padding-default--HJn66"><header></header><div class="contentContainer--8r-EZ"><div class="_rightContent_17bj8_62 flex flex-column"><h2 class="_headerNode_17bj8_93 flex width-full font-weight-bold dls-white brandAltbg text-align-left">Apply for an Account in minutes</h2><ol aria-labelledby="tracker" class="flex flex-justify-between flex-column"><li class="step active"><div class="dot-bar flex flex-row flex-justify-start flex-align-baseline"><div class="dot-completed _progressDot_17bj8_76" tabindex="-1"><div class="dot dls-white body-bold">1<!-- -->.</div></div><div class="pad-1-l text-align-left dls-white"><p class="body-1 pad-1-b-sm-down margin-0"><span class="body">Complete an Application</span><span class="body-1"><br/>and we&#x27;ll verify your identity – you&#x27;ll receive a confirmation email when your Account is approved and opened.</span></p></div></div></li><li class="step active"><div class="dot-bar flex flex-row flex-justify-start flex-align-baseline"><div class="dot-completed _progressDot_17bj8_76" tabindex="-1"><div class="dot dls-white body-bold">2<!-- -->.</div></div><div class="pad-1-l text-align-left dls-white"><p class="body-1 pad-1-b-sm-down margin-0"><span class="body">Register your online account</span><span class="body-1"><br/>after you receive your confirmation email.</span></p></div></div></li><li class="step active"><div class="dot-bar flex flex-row flex-justify-start flex-align-baseline"><div class="dot-completed _progressDot_17bj8_76" tabindex="-1"><div class="dot dls-white body-bold">3<!-- -->.</div></div><div class="pad-1-l text-align-left dls-white"><p class="body-1 pad-1-b-sm-down margin-0"><span class="body">Sign in and fund your new Account</span><span class="body-1"><br/>by depositing a check using your mobile phone⁶, transferring funds from an American Express<sup>®</sup> Rewards Checking account or linking to your current bank⁷. Linking an external account can take up to two days. Or you may also mail a check.</span></p></div></div></li></ol><div class="_ctaWrapperDesktop_17bj8_81"><div class="callToActionWithLinks"><div><a class="btn btn-primary body-3 dls-white-bg width-full margin-2-t _ctaButton_17bj8_130" href="" target="_self" rel="" style="horizontally-fluid:">Open an Account</a></div></div></div></div></div></article></div></div></section><p class="body pad-2-t text-align-center">See <a class="text-underline" href="https://www.americanexpress.com/en-us/banking/online-savings/support/?linknav=savings-nav-support" target="_blank">FAQs</a> for further details about the transfer process, or <a class="text-underline" href="https://www.americanexpress.com/en-us/banking/online-savings/contact-us/?intlink=savingshysa-startbanking-contact" target="_blank">contact us 24/7</a> with questions.</p></div></section></div><section><div class="section-container pad-0-t screen-bleed screen-bleed-gray"><div><div class="_tileWrapper_1akes_66"><div><div class="position-relative _bannerContent_1akes_1 _noBulletPoints_1akes_137 _withBorder_1akes_131 radius-container"><section class="container--1-j60 horizontal---OJ1g _contentTile_1akes_5"><div data-dls-surface="foreground" class="_surface_1ypbo_3"><div class="body-left--reJMC"><div class="image-left--lNBa2"><picture><source srcSet="https://icm.aexp-static.com/Internet/Acquisition/US_en/AppContent/OneSite/hysa/uplift/basic-mobile.png 1x, https://icm.aexp-static.com/Internet/Acquisition/US_en/AppContent/OneSite/hysa/uplift/basic-mobile.png 2x" media="(max-width: 799px)"/><source srcSet="https://icm.aexp-static.com/Internet/Acquisition/US_en/AppContent/OneSite/hysa/uplift/basic-tablet.png 1x, https://icm.aexp-static.com/Internet/Acquisition/US_en/AppContent/OneSite/hysa/uplift/basic-tablet.png 2x" media="(min-width: 800px) and (max-width: 1023px)"/><source srcSet="https://icm.aexp-static.com/Internet/Acquisition/US_en/AppContent/OneSite/hysa/uplift/basic-desktop.png 1x, https://icm.aexp-static.com/Internet/Acquisition/US_en/AppContent/OneSite/hysa/uplift/basic-desktop.png 2x" media="(min-width: 1024px)"/><img loading="lazy" src="https://icm.aexp-static.com/Internet/Acquisition/US_en/AppContent/OneSite/hysa/uplift/basic-mobile.png" alt="" class="_bannerImage_1akes_76"/></picture></div><article class="content--mPGHX padding-default--HJn66"><header><h3 class="_tileTitle_1akes_83">The Basics of High Yield Savings Accounts</h3></header><div class="contentContainer--8r-EZ"><div class="_tileBody_1akes_91"><p class="body-3 pad-1-t">A high-yield savings account (HYSA) generally offers higher interest rates than traditional savings accounts. They combine the flexibility of regular deposits and withdrawals with the benefit of earning more on your savings. Learn more about saving with a HYSA account. <a class="text-underline" href="https://www.americanexpress.com/en-us/banking/online-savings/articles/all-about-high-yield-savings/?intlink=us-acq-shop-consumer-saving-HYSA-learnmore" target="_blank" aria-label="Learn more about The Basics of the High-Yield Savings Accounts">Learn More</a></p></div></div></article></div></div></section></div></div></div><div class="_tileWrapper_1akes_66"><div><div class="position-relative _bannerContent_1akes_1 _noBulletPoints_1akes_137 _withBorder_1akes_131 radius-container"><section class="container--1-j60 horizontal---OJ1g _contentTile_1akes_5"><div data-dls-surface="foreground" class="_surface_1ypbo_3"><div class="body-right--NqURM"><article class="content--mPGHX padding-default--HJn66"><header><h3 class="_tileTitle_1akes_83">Access your Account On the Go</h3></header><div class="contentContainer--8r-EZ"><div class="_tileBody_1akes_91"><p class="body-3 pad-1-t">Scan the QR code to download the award-winning<br/> American Express<sup>®</sup> App on your mobile device.⁸ Seamlessly manage all your personal American Express<sup>®</sup> Card and Amex bank accounts on the go.</p></div></div></article><div class="image-right--cXNdk"><picture><source srcSet="https://icm.aexp-static.com/Internet/Acquisition/US_en/AppContent/OneSite/hysa/uplift/access-your-account-on-the-go-mobile-appstore.png 1x, https://icm.aexp-static.com/Internet/Acquisition/US_en/AppContent/OneSite/hysa/uplift/access-your-account-on-the-go-mobile-appstore.png 2x" media="(max-width: 799px)"/><source srcSet="https://icm.aexp-static.com/Internet/Acquisition/US_en/AppContent/OneSite/hysa/uplift/access-your-account-on-the-go-tablet-qr.png 1x, https://icm.aexp-static.com/Internet/Acquisition/US_en/AppContent/OneSite/hysa/uplift/access-your-account-on-the-go-tablet-qr.png 2x" media="(min-width: 800px) and (max-width: 1023px)"/><source srcSet="https://icm.aexp-static.com/Internet/Acquisition/US_en/AppContent/OneSite/hysa/uplift/access-your-account-on-the-go-desktop-qr.png 1x, https://icm.aexp-static.com/Internet/Acquisition/US_en/AppContent/OneSite/hysa/uplift/access-your-account-on-the-go-desktop-qr.png 2x" media="(min-width: 1024px)"/><img loading="lazy" src="https://icm.aexp-static.com/Internet/Acquisition/US_en/AppContent/OneSite/hysa/uplift/access-your-account-on-the-go-mobile-appstore.png" alt="QR code to download the Amex App" class="_bannerImage_1akes_76"/></picture></div></div></div></section><div class="pad-2 position-absolute-bl"></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="screen-bleed screen-bleed-blue"><div class="_container_pp0ls_1 _hysa_pp0ls_25 hysa"><div data-dls-surface="base" class="background--6ehzA"><div class="container--ABT-g"><div data-dls-surface="foreground" class="innerContainer--Co3x7"><div class="cardContainer--HUHGW"></div><div><h2 class="_header_pp0ls_46 font-weight-400 width-full pad-3-b">Let’s start looking ahead. Your interest earnings are waiting.</h2><div class="callToActionWithLinks"><div><a class="btn btn-primary _ctaButton_pp0ls_65" href="" target="_self" rel="" style="horizontally-fluid:">Open an Account</a></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><section class="section-container screen-bleed screen-bleed-subtle"></section><div class="max-width-sm section-container screen-bleed screen-bleed-surface-background"><div class="_bannerContainer_1vuqv_1 flex-align-items-center"><div class="_logoContainer_1vuqv_6"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="53" height="22" viewBox="0 0 53 22" fill="none"><path d="M47.796 5.26448C49.597 5.26448 51.3287 6.06801 52.3955 7.56423V1.0529C50.8438 0.387909 49.2922 0 47.602 0C44.762 0 41.9081 1.27456 39.927 3.38035C38.0013 5.43073 36.9622 8.17381 36.9622 11.0277C36.9622 14.131 37.9874 16.8463 40.204 18.9244C42.296 20.8917 44.9698 22 47.7821 22C49.4169 22 50.6637 21.5844 52.4093 21.0302V14.5189C51.3149 15.8766 49.597 16.7355 47.8929 16.7355C44.6234 16.7355 42.4345 14.3526 42.4345 11.0554C42.4345 7.75819 44.5957 5.26448 47.8098 5.26448M31.0189 21.4597H36.2557V0.554156H31.0189V21.4597ZM19.0076 16.8602H17.83V5.15365H19.063C22.4433 5.15365 24.8123 7.25945 24.8123 11C24.8123 15.073 22.1385 16.8463 19.0076 16.8463M20.005 0.554156H12.5655V21.4597H20.005C25.602 21.4597 30.2569 16.8879 30.2569 11.0139C30.2569 5.1398 25.6297 0.554156 20.005 0.554156ZM0 21.4458H5.23678V13.2443H10.9861V8.64484H5.23678V5.15365H11.5819V0.554156H0V21.4597V21.4458Z" fill="#00175A"></path></svg></div><p class="body _disclaimerText_1vuqv_10">Accounts offered by American Express National Bank. Member FDIC.</p></div></div><section class="section-container pad-0-b screen-bleed screen-bleed-surface-background"><div class="max-width-sm pad-0-lr"><section aria-label="frequently asked questions section"><div><h2 class="_header_1i9lx_97 heading-sans-medium-regular">Frequently Asked Questions</h2><div class="_qandaContainer_1i9lx_1"><div class="_accordion_3vqkn_3 _accordionContainer_1i9lx_10" id="faq-accordion"><hr aria-hidden="true"/><button type="button" id="header-faq-panel-0" aria-controls="content-faq-panel-0" aria-expanded="false" class="_panel_3vqkn_3"><div><div><span class="body-bold _questionText_1i9lx_24 _questionHeading_1i9lx_45">What is an American Express High Yield Savings Account (HYSA)?</span></div></div><div class="_chevron_3vqkn_20"><span class="_icon_j06u8_3" data-dls-icon-size="md"><svg viewBox="0 0 48 48" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true" width="1em" height="1em"><path d="M5.547 13.426a1.5 1.5 0 1 0-2.094 2.148l19.5 19a1.5 1.5 0 0 0 2.094 0l19.5-19a1.5 1.5 0 1 0-2.094-2.148L24 31.406z"></path></svg></span></div></button><div id="content-faq-panel-0" role="region" aria-labelledby="header-faq-panel-0" aria-hidden="true" class="_content_3vqkn_96" style="height:0px"><div class="_answerContainer_1i9lx_92"><div class="body-3 _answerText_1i9lx_61" id="faq-0-0">The American Express High Yield Savings Account is a savings account with a variable interest rate. Interest on our HYSA is compounded daily and posted to accounts monthly.</div></div></div><hr aria-hidden="true"/><button type="button" id="header-faq-panel-1" aria-controls="content-faq-panel-1" aria-expanded="false" class="_panel_3vqkn_3"><div><div><span class="body-bold _questionText_1i9lx_24 _questionHeading_1i9lx_45">Do I get an ATM card, a debit card, or checks when I open an American Express HYSA?</span></div></div><div class="_chevron_3vqkn_20"><span class="_icon_j06u8_3" data-dls-icon-size="md"><svg viewBox="0 0 48 48" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true" width="1em" height="1em"><path d="M5.547 13.426a1.5 1.5 0 1 0-2.094 2.148l19.5 19a1.5 1.5 0 0 0 2.094 0l19.5-19a1.5 1.5 0 1 0-2.094-2.148L24 31.406z"></path></svg></span></div></button><div id="content-faq-panel-1" role="region" aria-labelledby="header-faq-panel-1" aria-hidden="true" class="_content_3vqkn_96" style="height:0px"><div class="_answerContainer_1i9lx_92"><div class="body-3 _answerText_1i9lx_61" id="faq-1-0">Savings accounts are not meant for everyday spending. ATM cards, debit cards, or checks are not provided. However, for your everyday spending needs, you may be eligible for an American Express<sup>®</sup> Rewards Checking account. Additional terms and eligibility apply. To learn more about an American Express Rewards Checking account, please visit <a class="text-underline" href="https://www.americanexpress.com/en-us/banking/checking-account/" target="_blank">americanexpress.com/rewardschecking</a>.</div></div></div><hr aria-hidden="true"/><button type="button" id="header-faq-panel-2" aria-controls="content-faq-panel-2" aria-expanded="false" class="_panel_3vqkn_3"><div><div><span class="body-bold _questionText_1i9lx_24 _questionHeading_1i9lx_45">What is the difference between Individual and Joint Accounts?</span></div></div><div class="_chevron_3vqkn_20"><span class="_icon_j06u8_3" data-dls-icon-size="md"><svg viewBox="0 0 48 48" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true" width="1em" height="1em"><path d="M5.547 13.426a1.5 1.5 0 1 0-2.094 2.148l19.5 19a1.5 1.5 0 0 0 2.094 0l19.5-19a1.5 1.5 0 1 0-2.094-2.148L24 31.406z"></path></svg></span></div></button><div id="content-faq-panel-2" role="region" aria-labelledby="header-faq-panel-2" aria-hidden="true" class="_content_3vqkn_96" style="height:0px"><div class="_answerContainer_1i9lx_92"><div class="body-3 _answerText_1i9lx_61" id="faq-2-0">An Individual Account is an account in the name of one person. A Joint Account with Right of Survivorship (and not as Tenants in Common) is an account in the name of two persons. Each account holder intends that when they die, the balance in the account (subject to any previous pledge to which we have agreed) will belong to the survivor.</div><div class="body-3 _answerText_1i9lx_61" id="faq-2-1"><br/>Please note: The interest earned on the account will be reported to the IRS under the Social Security number of the primary (first named) account holder. Each joint account holder has equal access to the Joint Account but does not have access to online tax forms. American Express National Bank may act on instructions and notices we receive from any one joint account holder.</div></div></div><hr aria-hidden="true"/><button type="button" id="header-faq-panel-3" aria-controls="content-faq-panel-3" aria-expanded="false" class="_panel_3vqkn_3"><div><div><span class="body-bold _questionText_1i9lx_24 _questionHeading_1i9lx_45">What is the difference between Interest Rate and APY?</span></div></div><div class="_chevron_3vqkn_20"><span class="_icon_j06u8_3" data-dls-icon-size="md"><svg viewBox="0 0 48 48" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true" width="1em" height="1em"><path d="M5.547 13.426a1.5 1.5 0 1 0-2.094 2.148l19.5 19a1.5 1.5 0 0 0 2.094 0l19.5-19a1.5 1.5 0 1 0-2.094-2.148L24 31.406z"></path></svg></span></div></button><div id="content-faq-panel-3" role="region" aria-labelledby="header-faq-panel-3" aria-hidden="true" class="_content_3vqkn_96" style="height:0px"><div class="_answerContainer_1i9lx_92"><div class="body-3 _answerText_1i9lx_61" id="faq-3-0">Interest Rate is the annualized rate applied to the principal balance of the account each day in order to determine the amount of interest that has accrued on that day’s principal balance. Annual Percentage Yield (APY) reflects the effect of compounding frequency (Savings accounts are compounded daily) on the interest rate over a 365-day period.</div><div class="body-3 _answerText_1i9lx_61" id="faq-3-1"><br/>For more information, please see the <a class="text-underline" href="https://www.americanexpress.com/content/dam/amex/en-us/banking/personal-savings/deposit_account_agreement.pdf?extlink=US-Servicing-null-savingsdaa" target="_blank">Consumer Deposit Account Agreement and Savings Schedules</a> for additional terms and conditions and Truth-In-Savings disclosures.</div></div></div><hr aria-hidden="true"/><button type="button" id="header-faq-panel-4" aria-controls="content-faq-panel-4" aria-expanded="false" class="_panel_3vqkn_3"><div><div><span class="body-bold _questionText_1i9lx_24 _questionHeading_1i9lx_45">How long does it usually take to transfer funds online?</span></div></div><div class="_chevron_3vqkn_20"><span class="_icon_j06u8_3" data-dls-icon-size="md"><svg viewBox="0 0 48 48" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true" width="1em" height="1em"><path d="M5.547 13.426a1.5 1.5 0 1 0-2.094 2.148l19.5 19a1.5 1.5 0 0 0 2.094 0l19.5-19a1.5 1.5 0 1 0-2.094-2.148L24 31.406z"></path></svg></span></div></button><div id="content-faq-panel-4" role="region" aria-labelledby="header-faq-panel-4" aria-hidden="true" class="_content_3vqkn_96" style="height:0px"><div class="_answerContainer_1i9lx_92"><div class="body-3 _answerText_1i9lx_61" id="faq-4-0">The best method for transferring funds is typically by initiating an ACH transfer on the website of the bank where the funds are currently held. By doing this, you are pushing funds to the recipient bank. If you open a High Yield Savings Account (HYSA) with American Express, the fastest way to transfer your funds out HYSA and into another account would be by initiating the transfer on the American Express site. In many cases, you may qualify for express transfers that can appear as soon as the same day.</div><div class="body-3 _answerText_1i9lx_61" id="faq-4-1"><br/>However, if you chose to initiate an ACH transfer with the bank where you want funds to arrive, you would then be pulling funds. If the recipient bank is American Express National Bank and you initiated the transfer on the American Express website, the amount will be reflected in your Current Balance and will begin earning interest immediately. For more information about funds availability and withdrawal timing, please see the <a class="text-underline" href="https://www.americanexpress.com/content/dam/amex/en-us/banking/personal-savings/deposit_terms.pdf" target="_blank">Savings Schedule and Deposit Account Agreement</a>.</div></div></div></div></div><div><p class="_questionText_1i9lx_24 _footerText_1i9lx_65">Have other questions? Get more answers by reviewing our full list of  <a class="text-underline" title="FAQs link" aria-label="Link to FAQs page" href="https://www.americanexpress.com/en-us/banking/online-savings/support/?linknav=savings-nav-support" target="_blank">FAQs</a>.</p></div><div class="flex flex-wrap _disclaimerLinks_1i9lx_102"><a href="https://www.americanexpress.com/en-us/banking/legal-library/index.html?extlink=US-Web-null-depositslegal" target="_blank" class="text-underline"><div class="flex legal-1"><span class="_icon_j06u8_3 _disclaimerIcon_1i9lx_120" data-dls-icon-size="sm" data-dls-icon-color="brand" role="img" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 48 48" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="false" role="img" width="1em" height="1em"><title>IconDocument icon</title><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M30 0v.017c.298.02.593.118.838.313l.119.106 10.606 10.607c.228.228.356.513.403.809l.017.148H42v33a3.01 3.01 0 0 1-2.825 2.995L39 48H9a3.01 3.01 0 0 1-2.995-2.824L6 45V3A3.01 3.01 0 0 1 8.824.005L9 0zm-3 3H9v42h30V15h-9a3.01 3.01 0 0 1-2.995-2.824L27 12zm3 9V3.722L38.278 12z" clip-rule="evenodd"></path></svg></span>Consumer Banking Legal Agreements</div></a><a href="https://www.americanexpress.com/en-us/banking/online-savings/support/printable-forms/?intlink=savingshysa-support-forms" target="_blank" class="text-underline"><div class="flex legal-1"><span class="_icon_j06u8_3 _disclaimerIcon_1i9lx_120" data-dls-icon-size="sm" data-dls-icon-color="brand" role="img" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 48 48" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="false" role="img" width="1em"